    {
      "id": "52",
      "type": "details",
      "attributes": {
        "key": "documentation",
        "value": "A REFERENCE\nstate carries a bodyReference to an arbitrary EObject. If this object is another\nState, e.g. from another file, this reference can be used to modularize\nSyncCharts. In such case all original interface of the referenced state\nneeds to be redefined by {@link Substitution} objects."
